But that you withdraw and think that it doesn't have to be for me anymore.

370
01:31:51.506 --> 01:31:59.506
The mountain is that you actually go looking for God. That you open the Bible and start reading.

371
01:31:59.506 --> 01:32:05.506
That you put on worship music and sing along, even if you may not feel it.

372
01:32:05.506 --> 01:32:11.506
That you go talk to Him and simply open your heart to Him. Saying, Lord, I am having a hard time.

373
01:32:11.506 --> 01:32:16.506
I don't understand it, it hurts. Why is it taking so long? Why are you not doing anything about it?

374
01:32:16.506 --> 01:32:21.506
All those questions you may have, you should take them to Jesus.

375
01:32:21.506 --> 01:32:25.506
Not to the desert, but up the mountain.

376
01:32:26.506 --> 01:32:35.506
If you are in a desert period, if you are depressed, if you are having a hard time, if you are in pain, if you don't know anymore for a while.

377
01:32:37.506 --> 01:32:44.506
Do you know what is so beautiful? Even if you go to the desert, God is there too.

378
01:32:44.506 --> 01:32:50.506
Even though He wants to meet you on the mountain, He is also there, for He sends angels to Elijah.

379
01:32:50.506 --> 01:32:56.506
To meet him there. To give him new strength, so that he can go up the mountain.

380
01:32:56.506 --> 01:33:06.506
So if you are currently in a difficult phase, I bless you in the name of Jesus, that God sends His angels to you.

381
01:33:06.506 --> 01:33:11.506
That God gives you what you need for new strength at this moment.

382
01:33:11.506 --> 01:33:16.506
To open the Bible again, to worship again.

383
01:33:16.506 --> 01:33:20.506
To open your heart to Him again, to talk to Him.

384
01:33:20.506 --> 01:33:28.506
And I want to challenge you, for this week, to go up the mountain every day.

385
01:33:28.506 --> 01:33:33.506
Whether you feel it or not. Open the Bible every day.

386
01:33:34.506 --> 01:33:39.506
Sing along to a worship song every day. And talk to Him.

387
01:33:39.506 --> 01:33:45.506
Open your heart. Just honestly say what is there. You don't have to pretend to be better.

388
01:33:45.506 --> 01:33:50.506
You don't have to overcome your sin or your pain first.

389
01:33:50.506 --> 01:33:54.506
Just go to Him and say what you feel and say what you think.

390
01:33:54.506 --> 01:34:00.506
Be angry with Him if you are angry. Shout it out to Him if you are upset.

391
01:34:00.506 --> 01:34:05.506
Or if you don't understand anything anymore. But go to Jesus this week, every day.

392
01:34:05.506 --> 01:34:08.506
Blessed week and follow Jesus.
